{"slug": "what-we-bring-capabilities-brought-together", "title": "Capabilities brought together — What we bring — SetuHashi", "description": "Build around the opportunity.", "mainClass": "main-bring", "scripts": [], "langHref": "/ja/what-we-bring-capabilities-brought-together/", "html": "<div class=\"wrap\"><nav class=\"crumbs\" aria-label=\"You are here\"><ol><li><a href=\"/en/\">Home</a></li><li><a href=\"/en/what-we-bring/\">What we bring</a></li><li><span aria-current=\"page\">Capabilities brought together</span></li></ol></nav><div class=\"layout\"><aside class=\"local\" aria-label=\"What we bring\">\n<p class=\"local-k\"><a href=\"/en/what-we-bring/\">What we bring</a></p>\n<p class=\"local-lead\">Complementary strengths. Connected to delivery.</p><p class=\"local-intro\">Cross-border business needs more than an introduction or a good plan. We bring together understanding, commercial development and practical capabilities around the opportunity.</p>\n<details class=\"local-d\" open><summary><span>In this section: Capabilities brought together</span><span class=\"ln-count\">3 of 4</span></summary>\n<nav aria-label=\"In this section\"><ul class=\"ln\"><li><a href=\"/en/what-we-bring/\"><span class=\"ln-l\">Both sides together</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/en/what-we-bring-development-connected-to-delivery/\"><span class=\"ln-l\">Development connected to delivery</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/en/what-we-bring-capabilities-brought-together/\" aria-current=\"page\"><span class=\"ln-l\">Capabilities brought together</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/en/what-we-bring-involvement-that-fits/\"><span class=\"ln-l\">Involvement that fits</span></a></li></ul></nav></details>\n</aside><article class=\"view\" aria-labelledby=\"vh\">\n<h1 id=\"vh\" class=\"v-h\">Capabilities brought together</h1><p class=\"v-tag\">Build around the opportunity.</p>\n<div class=\"v-grid\"><div class=\"v-body\"><p>We start with what you and your partners already bring, then identify what else the work needs. That may include market knowledge, operating capability, technology or appropriately qualified specialists.</p><p>We help bring those contributions together and clarify how the participants will work alongside one another.</p><div class=\"v-mean\"><p class=\"lab\">What this means for you</p><p>Capabilities selected for the assignment, with clear responsibilities for each participant.</p></div></div><div class=\"v-fig\"><figure class=\"fig fig-bring\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 360 230\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Opportunity: You, Partners, Specialists, Capabilities\" focusable=\"false\"><line class=\"ln\" x1=\"180\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"28\"/><line class=\"ln\" x1=\"180\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"310\" y2=\"110\"/><line class=\"ln\" x1=\"180\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"192\"/><line class=\"ln\" x1=\"180\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"110\"/><circle class=\"hub\" cx=\"180\" cy=\"110\" r=\"53\"/><text x=\"180\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"em inv hub-t\">Opportunity</text><rect class=\"f\" x=\"132\" y=\"11\" width=\"96\" height=\"34\"/><text x=\"180\" y=\"33\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"sm\">You</text><rect class=\"f\" x=\"262\" y=\"93\" width=\"96\" height=\"34\"/><text x=\"310\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"sm\">Partners</text><rect class=\"f\" x=\"132\" y=\"175\" width=\"96\" height=\"34\"/><text x=\"180\" y=\"197\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"sm\">Specialists</text><rect class=\"f\" x=\"2\" y=\"93\" width=\"96\" height=\"34\"/><text x=\"50\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"sm\">Capabilities</text></svg></figure></div></div>\n<div class=\"onward\"><h2 class=\"lab\">How this works in practice</h2><p><a class=\"arrow\" href=\"/en/how-we-work-working-together/\">Working together</a></p></div>\n<nav class=\"pager\" aria-label=\"Previous and next\"><a class=\"pg pg-prev\" href=\"/en/what-we-bring-development-connected-to-delivery/\"><span class=\"pg-k\">Previous</span>Development connected to delivery</a><a class=\"pg pg-next\" href=\"/en/what-we-bring-involvement-that-fits/\"><span class=\"pg-k\">Next</span>Involvement that fits</a></nav>\n</article></div></div>"}